	"Description": "Minimal host project that builds DreamLoc on its own and runs its automation tests, away from any working project. DreamGUI is in it too, for the end-to-end check that a .dui's text follows the .dloc files. Generated from Plugins/DreamLoc/Tools/TestHost/Template by New-DreamLocTestHost.ps1.",
